auma experienced by Anne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u27a4 Emphasis will be placed on Anne's smartphone, which will feature numerous functions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.poster.avif?t=1768561756\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.webm?t=1768561756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.mp4?t=1768561756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>","developers":["Serafini Productions"],"dlc":[4114580],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/7c168ddfd9f44a9660ded3c23ef259362c4a7bdc/header.jpg?t=1768561756","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Serafini Productions \u00ae All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2133830/218436944/fc2de0b870dad5063a2e942d3320d8c20db0e75d/1765508435/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765509304","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2133830/218436944/fc2de0b870dad5063a2e942d3320d8c20db0e75d/1765508435/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765509304","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2133830/218436944/fc2de0b870dad5063a2e942d3320d8c20db0e75d/1765508435/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765509304","id":257248009,"name":"BrokenLore: UNFOLLOW - Official Trailer (2025)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257248009/80b39339f907eeb45fc650bc63360f3cb976d296/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765509304"},{"dash_av1":"http